  "metadata": {
    "player": {
      "projectName": "exampleadventure",
      "name": "Talion",
      "bio": "Role: Young Adventurer / Frontline Beginner\nSpecies: Human\nAge: 18–21\nAppearance: Short brown hair, brown eyes, simple travel clothes, cheap sword, basic shield, boots that squeak when wet.\n\nPersonality:\nTalion is brave in the way only someone with very little experience can be brave. He means well, tries hard, and often says heroic things five seconds before realizing he has no plan.\n\nStrengths:\nHe is determined, loyal, surprisingly quick on his feet, and good at keeping the group moving.\n\nWeaknesses:\nHe overestimates himself, underestimates doors, and has a habit of accepting quests before reading the small print.\n\nRunning Gag:\nHis sword is technically called “Iron Fang,” but only because Talion named it that. Everyone else calls it “The Butter Knife.”\n\nPersonal Goal:\nTo become a real adventurer, earn enough coin to buy proper gear, and maybe one day have a cloak that does not smell faintly of soup."
    },
    "last_opened_at": 1784421726452,
    "project_notes": "Hello there!\nThis is a simple sample project.\nIt comes with everything needed to play an adventure in this simple fictional world. \nExplore the included files here, then switch to the \"Viewer\" tab and give it a try.",
